A||N||82||87ECO5||PFF Calendar 2001 (price and taking orders)||||1||
Z||000000||87ECO5||10-31-2000||02:32 PM||||I'm pleased to announce that development has begun on the 2001 PFF Fiero calendar and I have some exciting news to share about it.  This year's calendar will include 40-50 cars (double that of last year's 21 cars).  Also, the new calendar will double in size from last year's (printed on 11" by 17" paper instead of 8.5" by 11") and will make use of better grade paper.  Finally, the new calendar will use "saddle stitching" instead of the less than friendly "comb binding" found on last year's calendar.<P><B>Price has been set at $12 per calendar (plus shipping) and they'll be ready for shipment during the first week of December.</B><P>A few of you sent your order(s) along with your photo(s).  I apologize for this but I did not keep track of those.  So, I'm asking that you reply to this thread with the number of calendars you wish to purchase.  That way, I don't have to worry about losing someone's email note (and it keeps this thread at the top of the forum).  I checked the "Email Notification" box so there's no need to send a separate email note stating that you responded to the thread.  If you have questions, please contact me directly -  <A HREF="mailto:Fiero87EC5@aol.com">Fiero87EC5@aol.com</A> <P>FieroWife and I are planning to print them sometime during the last week of November.  That means you have about 4 weeks to get your orders in.<P><B>DO NOT</B> send money now.  We'll post another thread when we're ready to begin accepting payments.<P>"Thank you" to Cliff for allowing me to use the forum to solicit buyers!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
